        <td><strong>Zero-Stock Out-of-Stock Logic</strong></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span class="pass-badge">PASS</span></td>
        <td>
          <div class="test-text">Set blank stock quantity to 0 on a specific variant and checked catalog.</div>
          <div class="result-text">Product remains visible in catalog with "Out of Stock" badge; purchase button safely disabled.</div>
