  <div class="conclusion-box">
    <div style="font-weight: bold; color: #166534; font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 4px;">Audit Conclusion & Formal Sign-Off</div>
    <p style="margin: 0; color: #15803d; font-size: 10pt;">
      All customer guest/auth flows, bilingual Arabic (RTL) and English (LTR) interfaces, 300 DPI lossless master print validation, automated 3-sample designer qualification, inventory separation (blank stock vs. ready-to-sell), and admin commission controls have <strong>PASSED verification with 100% compliance and zero regressions</strong>.
